# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
The goal of this project is to explore sustainable production methods in Parisian fashion design. We will focus on reducing waste, using environmentally-friendly materials, and promoting fair labor practices.<br>
<br>
## Methods<br>
We will conduct research on the current state of sustainable fashion in Paris, including interviews with designers, manufacturers, and suppliers. We will also analyze data on the environmental impact of traditional fashion production methods.<br>
<br>
## Expected Outcomes<br>
This project aims to identify best practices for sustainable fashion production in Paris, including recommendations for materials, manufacturing processes, and supply chain management.<br>
```<br>
